Scope of this licence

This MIT licence covers the source code in this repository (src/, tests/,
run_pipeline.py, configs/, reports/paper/*.js|*.py|*.ps1, frontend/ source).

It does NOT cover:
- The LEN / LEN-Small dataset, which is not included in this repository and
  must be obtained from the LEN project (see data/DATA_MANIFEST.md).
- The derived event-level files in data/manifests/, outputs/ and
  frontend/public/data/. They are derived from LEN-Small, whose release states
  no licence or redistribution terms that we could identify; they are provided
  for research reproducibility only and are not endorsed by the LEN authors.
- The research paper text and figures (reports/*.docx, reports/*.pdf,
  reports/paper/figures/), which remain copyright of the authors.
